# Currency rules, English.
#
# [currency.symbol]: form | ISO 4217 code | prefix, suffix or both | confidence (optional). The sign for "$5" or "5€".
# [currency.name]: forms, comma-separated | ISO 4217 code | value of one in the currency (optional, 0.01 for cents) | confidence (optional).
# [currency.code]: the alphabetic codes of the ISO 4217 list of currencies, in capitals, as
#                  "USD 5" or "5 USD". Lower-case "usd" is not read: several codes are English words (ALL, TRY, TOP, PEN).

